=== (d) Bonus claim stress test: c_n = log(n) (NOT covered by Corolario 2) ===
Corolario 2 needs gamma_n n^(1/3)/ln n -> infinity;
for c_n=log(n): gamma_n = log(n)/n, so gamma_n n^(1/3)/ln n = n^(1/3)/n = n^(-2/3) -> 0.
Corolario 2's hypothesis genuinely FAILS here -- this sequence is only reachable
by the bonus claim (c_n -> infinity, c_n = o(n), no rate restriction).
